<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 5,685 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 400 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  140   (135 and 151)</p>
<p>    Good		unq   (unq and 110)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     137   (130 and 104)</p>
<p>    Medium	    128   (123 and  93)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	107   ( 99 and  80)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 140 pence for a Landed Kenya PF1 and 146 pence for an offshore Kenya PF1.</p>
</text>
